  "review": {
    "gallery": "Eleven native or developer-gallery renders and three actual enabling-works photographs. The construction update describes the AYA site but gives no visible inspection date. Construction conditions remain visible in the actual site photographs. The waterfront render preserves the full building silhouette on the card and cover.",
    "location": "Brochure physical pages 12 and 14 were visually reviewed. They give 20 minutes to Al Marjan Island, 35 to Sharjah airport and 40 to Dubai airport. Page 14 marks the local site and numbers nearby destinations. The project-name directions fallback accompanies that original developer map because an official visitor-entrance coordinate was not found.",
    "floorPlans": "All 26 residence sheets in the website-linked PDF were rendered and visually reviewed. Three distinct older simplex sheets are included with an earlier-edition label and their original official PDF. Current 2 BR simplex is 2,158 sq ft versus the older 1,820 sq ft. Earlier-only 2 BR simplex-A and 3 BR simplex-A show 1,480 and 2,289 sq ft. Each original sheet retains its notices, logo, area panel and page link. Whole-home totals are repeated without being summed."
  },
